Hello DRUG users

I have a DF with two variables.

rail <- c("Often", "Rarely", "Sometimes", "Often", "Rarely", "Sometimes","Often", "Rarely", "Sometimes")
car <- c("Sometimes", "Often", "Rarely", "Sometimes","Often", "Rarely", "Sometimes", "Sometimes","Sometimes")
df <- as.data.frame(cbind(rail, car))

I want to create a summary DF where the columns (variables) are (1) Mode: Two categories - rail and car, (2) Often, (3) Sometimes, (4) Rarely. The values are the counts of responses. Please see attachment.

Mode Often Sometimes Rarely
Rail 3 3 3
Car 2 5 2

 Any suggestions how I should go about this?

Thanks

