The code below will get you most of the way there. (You can then create the Mode column from row.names):

data.frame(t(apply(df, 2, table)))

You could also check out the tidyr package (http://blog.rstudio.org/2014/07/22/introducing-tidyr/) which provides several flexible functions to do stuff like this.

Best,
Jaime

